The  file specifies several configuration parameters for the Ker‐
beros 5 library, as well as for some programs.  The file consists
of one or more sections, containing a number  of  bindings.   The
value  of  each binding can be either a string or a list of other
bindings.  The grammar looks  like:  file:          /*  empty  */
        sections

sections:         section sections         section

section:         ’[’ section_name ’]’ bindings

section_name:         STRING

bindings:         binding bindings         binding

binding:          name  ’=’  STRING         name ’=’ ’{’ bindings
’}’

name:         STRING

